      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784625085521,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LEGEND — solid border = built/active today · dashed border = planned.\nRoadmap: Phase 1 = audit foundation + PII + fail-closed floor (ACTIVE) → Phase 2 = Group B model I/O guardrails (PLANNED) → Phase 3 = Group A tool-use\nauthorization (this diagram's active core: Slice 0 done, Slices 1–5 building) → Phase 4 = Group C human-oversight escalation contract (PLANNED).\nGroup D's audit floor ships in Phase 1; its full monitoring/incident scope rides alongside Phases 2–4.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LEGEND — solid border = built/active today · dashed border = planned.\nRoadmap: Phase 1 = audit foundation + PII + fail-closed floor (ACTIVE) → Phase 2 = Group B model I/O guardrails (PLANNED) → Phase 3 = Group A tool-use\nauthorization (this diagram's active core: Slice 0 done, Slices 1–5 building) → Phase 4 = Group C human-oversight escalation contract (PLANNED).\nGroup D's audit floor ships in Phase 1; its full monitoring/incident scope rides alongside Phases 2–4.",
